  "RNL standard packages · Rich Netlist": "RNL 標準套件 · Rich Netlist",
  "The standard packages of Rich Netlist (RNL): what each package is for and the text that defines it, every symbol as it is drawn with its pins and box, and the rules that give elements their symbols.": "Rich Netlist（RNL）的標準套件：每個套件的用途與定義原文、每個符號繪製出的外觀、接腳與邊界框，以及為實例指定符號的規則。",
