  "This page needs JavaScript to show the gallery. The package files themselves are in <a href=\"https://github.com/rich-netlist/rnl/tree/main/libraries/standard\">libraries/standard/ on GitHub</a> and the <a href=\"https://github.com/rich-netlist/rnl-packages/tree/main/packages\">public packages repository</a>.": "本頁需要 JavaScript 才能顯示圖庫。套件檔案本身位於 <a href=\"https://github.com/rich-netlist/rnl/tree/main/libraries/standard\">GitHub 上的 libraries/standard/</a> 以及<a href=\"https://github.com/rich-netlist/rnl-packages/tree/main/packages\">公開套件儲存庫</a>。",
  "Close": "關閉",
  "The data on this page is generated at build time from the bundled standard packages and the <a href=\"https://github.com/rich-netlist/rnl-packages\">public package catalog</a>: every package file is read and every symbol is rendered by the RNL core. When a package file changes, this page updates the next time the site is published.": "本頁資料於網站建置時由內建標準套件與<a href=\"https://github.com/rich-netlist/rnl-packages\">公開套件目錄</a>產生：讀取每個套件檔案，並由 RNL 核心渲染每個符號。當套件檔案變更時，本頁會在下次網站發布時更新。",
